      "IndentLv": 1
    },
    {
      "Text": "The first item in a to-do list is always the hardest one to cross off.",
      "Who": null,
      "Mood": null,
      "Font": null,
      "Color": null,
      "Time": null,
      "Formats": null,
      "Speed": 0,
      "Position": 0,
      "Background": 1,
      "Event": null,
      "Index": 2,
      "RawCommand": "\"The first item in a to-do list is always the hardest one to cross off.\" background none",
      "IndentLv": 1
    },
    {
      "Text": "If we could just get one item done, the rest would surely follow. We just need to start.",
      "Who": null,
      "Mood": null,
      "Font": null,
      "Color": null,
      "Time": null,
      "Formats": null,
      "Speed": 0,
      "Position": 0,
      "Background": 1,
      "Event": null,
      "Index": 3,
      "RawCommand": "\"If we could just get one item done, the rest would surely follow. We just need to start.\" background none",
      "IndentLv": 1
    },
    {
      "Text": "That's why some people find the easiest item first, and start from there.",
      "Who": null,
      "Mood": null,
      "Font": null,
      "Color": null,
      "Time": null,
      "Formats": null,
      "Speed": 0,
      "Position": 0,
      "Background": 1,
      "Event": null,
      "Index": 4,
      "RawCommand": "\"That's why some people find the easiest item first, and start from there.\" background none",
      "IndentLv": 1
    },
    {
      "Text": "It gives them a better chance at getting something done.",
      "Who": null,
      "Mood": null,
      "Font": null,
      "Color": null,
      "Time": null,
      "Formats": null,
      "Speed": 0,
      "Position": 0,
      "Background": 1,
      "Event": null,
      "Index": 5,
      "RawCommand": "\"It gives them a better chance at getting something done.\" background none",
      "IndentLv": 1
    },
    {
      "Operation": 2,
      "Value": null,
      "Event": null,
      "Index": 6,
      "RawCommand": "hide ui",
      "IndentLv": 1
    },
    {
      "Type": 0,
      "Time": 1.5,
      "Event": null,
      "Index": 7,
      "RawCommand": "pause 1.5",
      "IndentLv": 1
    },
    {
      "Text": "This is because setting things in motion is difficult.",
      "Who": null,
      "Mood": null,
      "Font": null,
      "Color": null,
      "Time": null,
      "Formats": null,
      "Speed": 0,
      "Position": 0,
      "Background": 1,
      "Event": null,
      "Index": 8,
      "RawCommand": "\"This is because setting things in motion is difficult.\" background none",
      "IndentLv": 1
    },
    {
      "Text": "Choosing to do homework is difficult. Choosing to clean your room is difficult. Choosing to get out of bed is difficult.",
      "Who": null,
      "Mood": null,
      "Font": null,
      "Color": null,
      "Time": null,
      "Formats": null,
      "Speed": 0,
      "Position": 0,
      "Background": 1,
      "Event": null,
      "Index": 9,
      "RawCommand": "\"Choosing to do homework is difficult. Choosing to clean your room is difficult. Choosing to get out of bed is difficult.\" background none",
      "IndentLv": 1
    },
    {
      "Text": "Change is uncomfortable. It's always easier to leave things the way they are. To let the flow carry you.",
      "Who": null,
      "Mood": null,
      "Font": null,
      "Color": null,
      "Time": null,
      "Formats": null,
      "Speed": 0,
      "Position": 0,
      "Background": 1,
      "Event": null,
      "Index": 10,
      "RawCommand": "\"Change is uncomfortable. It's always easier to leave things the way they are. To let the flow carry you.\" background none",
      "IndentLv": 1
    },
    {
      "Operation": 2,
      "Value": null,
      "Event": null,
      "Index": 11,
      "RawCommand": "hide ui",
      "IndentLv": 1
    },
    {
      "Type": 0,
      "Time": 0.5,
      "Event": null,
      "Index": 12,
      "RawCommand": "pause 0.5",
      "IndentLv": 1
    },
    {
      "Text": "Until you reach a point where doing nothing does more damage than doing anything.",
      "Who": null,
      "Mood": null,
      "Font": null,
      "Color": null,
      "Time": null,
      "Formats": null,
      "Speed": 0,
      "Position": 0,
      "Background": 1,
      "Event": null,
      "Index": 13,
      "RawCommand": "\"Until you reach a point where doing nothing does more damage than doing anything.\" background none",
      "IndentLv": 1
    },
    {
      "Text": "When this happens, change is no longer a choice. It's a consequence.",
      "Who": null,
      "Mood": null,
      "Font": null,
      "Color": null,
      "Time": null,
      "Formats": null,
      "Speed": 0,
      "Position": 0,
      "Background": 1,
      "Event": null,
      "Index": 14,
      "RawCommand": "\"When this happens, change is no longer a choice. It's a consequence.\" background none",
      "IndentLv": 1
    },
    {
      "Text": "Is that also a choice? The choice to do nothing?",
      "Who": null,
      "Mood": null,
      "Font": null,
      "Color": null,
      "Time": null,
      "Formats": null,
      "Speed": 0,
      "Position": 0,
      "Background": 1,
      "Event": null,
      "Index": 15,
      "RawCommand": "\"Is that also a choice? The choice to do nothing?\" background none",
      "IndentLv": 1
    },
    {
      "Operation": 2,
      "Value": null,
      "Event": null,
      "Index": 16,
      "RawCommand": "hide ui",
      "IndentLv": 1
    },
    {
      "Type": 0,
